<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak c.bank forex reserves rise to $3.1 bln.</title>
<headline>Slovak c.bank forex reserves rise to $3.1 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Friday its hard currency reserves totalled $3.114 billion as of August 13, up from $3.025 billion on August 6.</p>
<p> SLOVAK FOREX RESERVES     Aug 13   Aug 6   July 30   Dec 31/96</p>
<p>  NBS reserves ($bln)	3.114    3.025    2.937    3.473</p>
<p>  Commercial banks	   3.651    3.691    3.602    2.321</p>
<p>  Entire banking sector    6.765    6.717    6.539    5.794</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
</text>
